.SH "DESCRIPTION"
\fBlibu8ident_c\fR is a stripped\-down variant of \fBlibu8ident\fR(3) for C and C++ compilers\. It is pre\-configured with the \fBTR39\fR profile (UTS#39 / P2528R1), NFC normalization, and always\-active Greek\-Latin confusable detection\.
.P
It validates UTF\-8 identifiers against Unicode security guidelines:
.IP "\[ci]" 4
XID (Identifier_Status / Identifier_Type) for allowed codepoints\.
.IP "\[ci]" 4
Allowed scripts: Recommended scripts only, 2\-script maximum\.
.IP "\[ci]" 4
Mixed\-script detection (e\.g\. Latin + Cyrillic)\.
.IP "\[ci]" 4
Confusable detection (Greek\-Latin homoglyphs)\.
.IP "\[ci]" 4
Combining\-mark sequence limits (max 4, NSM prohibitions, duplicate combining marks)\.
.IP "\[ci]" 4
MEDIAL and bidi control\.
.IP "" 0
.P
The library consists of a single source file and public header\. No private headers or external dependencies are needed\.
.SH "OPTIONS"
\fBu8ident_init()\fR validates its arguments but ignores them \(em the profile and normalization are hardcoded to TR39_4 and NFC\. Pass \fBU8ID_PROFILE_TR39_4, U8ID_NFC, 0\fR for forward compatibility\.
.SH "RETURN VALUES"
\fBu8ident_check()\fR and \fBu8ident_check_buf()\fR return:
.IP "\[ci]" 4
\fBU8ID_EOK\fR (0) \-\- Valid identifier\.
.IP "\[ci]" 4
\fBU8ID_ERR_XID\fR (\-1) \-\- Not in XID (Identifier_Status / Identifier_Type)\.
.IP "\[ci]" 4
\fBU8ID_ERR_SCRIPT\fR (\-2) \-\- Script not allowed (excluded or limited\-use)\.
.IP "\[ci]" 4
\fBU8ID_ERR_SCRIPTS\fR (\-3) \-\- Mixed\-scripts violation\.
.IP "\[ci]" 4
\fBU8ID_ERR_ENCODING\fR (\-4) \-\- Invalid UTF\-8 encoding\.
.IP "\[ci]" 4
\fBU8ID_ERR_COMBINE\fR (\-5) \-\- Invalid combining\-mark sequence\.
.IP "\[ci]" 4
\fBU8ID_ERR_CONFUS\fR (\-6) \-\- Confusable character (Greek\-Latin homoglyph)\.
.IP "" 0
.SH "FILES"
.IP "\[ci]" 4
\fBu8ident\-tr39\.c\fR \-\- Single\-file amalgam source (no preprocessor conditionals)\.
.IP "\[ci]" 4
\fBu8ident_c\.h\fR \-\- Public API header\.
.IP "\[ci]" 4
\fBunitr39\.h\fR \-\- Generated TR39 XID lists (self\-contained, generated by \fBmktr39\fR(1))\.
.IP "" 0
.SH "EXAMPLE"
```c #include
.P
int main(void) { u8ident_init(U8ID_PROFILE_TR39_4, U8ID_NFC, 0);
.IP "" 4
.nf
enum u8id_errors r =
    u8ident_check((const uint8_t *)"café", NULL);
if (r == U8ID_EOK)
    printf("OK\en");
else {
    u8id_ctx_t ctx = u8ident_new_ctx();
    printf("Error %d at U+%04X (%s)\en",
           r,
           u8ident_failed_char(ctx),
           u8ident_failed_script_name(ctx)
               ? u8ident_failed_script_name(ctx) : "");
}

